        "custom_liquid_yR4UPX": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .yc-desc { margin: 28px 0 0; }\n  .yc-desc__heading { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #233923; margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .yc-desc__text { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #233923; margin: 0; }\n  .yap-trust-bar { width: 100%; margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: inherit; }\n  .yap-trust-item { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 58px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .yap-trust-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .yap-trust-icon { width: 28px; min-width: 28px; margin-right: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #6b6b6b; }\n  .yap-trust-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: currentColor; fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n  .yap-trust-text { flex: 1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.15px; color: #232739; }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) { .yap-trust-item { min-height: 54px; padding: 9px 2px; } .yap-trust-text { font-size: 14px; } .yap-trust-icon { width: 26px; min-width: 26px; margin-right: 9px; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"yc-desc\">\n  <h2 class=\"yc-desc__heading\">The Autonomous Base for Every Season</h2>\n  <p class=\"yc-desc__text\">The Yarbo Core is the autonomous, all-terrain base at the center of an entire yard care system, built to run your property without you standing over it. RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion map your land to centimeter accuracy and hold a precise line even under tree cover, where GPS-only robots lose their way. A tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and rough terrain that stop wheeled machines outright, and it can tow up to 500 lbs for daily tasks or 3,500 lbs of rolling weight. On its own, the Core is the foundation, add the Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, or Leaf Blower module and it becomes a season-specific machine, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes. Every Core is covered by Yarbo's 2-year manufacturer warranty, backed by direct support from Yard Automation Pros before and after the sale.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yap-trust-bar\">\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 19 6v5c0 4.8-2.9 8.2-7 10-4.1-1.8-7-5.2-7-10V6l7-3z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">Price Match Available on Request | Returns Per Manufacturer Policy</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.5 6.5a4 4 0 0 0-5.2 5.2L4 17l3 3 5.3-5.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.2-5.2l-2.2 2.2-2.8-2.8 2-2.4z\"/><path d=\"M16 4h4\"/><path d=\"M18 2v4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">2-Year Manufacturer Warranty | US-Based Email Support</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h11v11H3z\"/><path d=\"M14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">10–14 Business Day Estimated Delivery</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/><path d=\"M12 14v3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">Secure Checkout | Protected Payment</div></div>\n</div>"
          }
