        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Core is a modular robotic yard automation platform designed for residential and commercial use. Powered by AI navigation and RTK GPS precision, it handles lawn mowing, snow blowing, and more, all from a single app. Quiet, efficient, and built to handle complex yard layouts with ease.<br/><br/>One machine. Every season. The Yarbo Core is the tracked, all-terrain base at the center of the entire Yarbo system. Add a module and it becomes a mower, a snow blower, or a leaf blower, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes.<br/><br/>🎯 No boundary wires. RTK GPS maps your property to centimeter accuracy.<br/>⛰️ Handles slopes up to 70% (35°), where wheeled robots fail.<br/>🔄 Modular by design. One base, multiple attachments, every season covered.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "custom_liquid_ycProdInfo": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<details class=\"collapsible-tab\">\n  <summary class=\"collapsible-tab__heading\">\n    <span>Product Information</span>\n    {% render 'icon-chevron-down-small' %}\n  </summary>\n  <div class=\"collapsible-tab__text\">\n    <p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>One machine. Every season.</strong></p><p>The Yarbo Core is the tracked, all-terrain base at the center of the entire Yarbo system. On its own, it’s the foundation. Add a module, and it becomes a mower, a snow blower, or a leaf blower, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes.</p><p><strong>Requires a module to run.</strong> The Core alone doesn’t mow, blow, or clear anything. If you don’t already own modules, a bundle like the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> includes the Core and gets you running immediately.</p><h3>Precision navigation, no boundary wires</h3><p>RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion map your property to centimeter accuracy and hold precise lines even under tree cover, where GPS-only robots drift.</p><h3>Built for real terrain</h3><p>A tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and rough ground that stop wheeled robots. Tow up to 500 lbs for daily tasks, or up to 3,500 lbs of rolling weight.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Delivery.</strong> Typically 10 to 14 days after your order.</li><li><strong>Covered by Yarbo’s 2 year manufacturer warranty</strong> on defective parts, excluding consumables, from your activation date.</li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>\n    {% assign yc_related = collections['yarbo'].products %}\n    {% if yc_related.size > 0 %}\n      <style>\n        .yc-upsell { margin-top: 32px; }\n        .yc-upsell__heading { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #233923; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; margin: 0 0 16px; }\n        .yc-upsell__track { display: flex; gap: 24px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x proximity; padding: 4px 4px 16px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }\n        .yc-upsell__card { flex: 0 0 220px; scroll-snap-align: start; border: 1px solid #d7ddd4; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; transition: box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }\n        .yc-upsell__card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(35,57,35,.14); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n        .yc-upsell__img-link { display: block; text-decoration: none; }\n        .yc-upsell__img-wrap { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; background: #f2f4f1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .yc-upsell__img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }\n        .yc-upsell__title-link { text-decoration: none; }\n        .yc-upsell__title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #233923; margin: 12px 14px 4px; line-height: 1.3; }\n        .yc-upsell__price { font-size: 13.5px; color: #233923; margin: 0 14px 12px; opacity: .8; }\n        .yc-upsell__add { display: block; width: calc(100% - 28px); margin: 0 14px 14px; padding: 9px 0; background: #233923; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .3px; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s ease; }\n        .yc-upsell__add:hover { background: #152616; }\n        .yc-upsell__add[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: default; }\n      </style>\n      <div class=\"yc-upsell\">\n        <p class=\"yc-upsell__heading\">Pairs Well With</p>\n        <div class=\"yc-upsell__track\">\n          {% for p in yc_related limit: 8 %}\n            {% unless p.id == product.id %}\n              {% assign yc_variant = p.selected_or_first_available_variant %}\n              <div class=\"yc-upsell__card\">\n                <a class=\"yc-upsell__img-link\" href=\"{{ p.url }}\">\n                  <div class=\"yc-upsell__img-wrap\">\n                    {% if p.featured_image %}\n                      <img src=\"{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"{{ p.featured_image.alt | default: p.title | escape }}\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n                    {% endif %}\n                  </div>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"yc-upsell__title-link\" href=\"{{ p.url }}\"><p class=\"yc-upsell__title\">{{ p.title }}</p></a>\n                <p class=\"yc-upsell__price\">{{ p.price | money }}</p>\n                {% if yc_variant %}\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"yc-upsell__add\" data-variant-id=\"{{ yc_variant.id }}\">Add to Cart</button>\n                {% else %}\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"yc-upsell__add\" disabled>Sold Out</button>\n                {% endif %}\n              </div>\n            {% endunless %}\n          {% endfor %}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <script>\n        (function () {\n          document.querySelectorAll('.yc-upsell__add[data-variant-id]').forEach(function (btn) {\n            btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n              var variantId = btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');\n              btn.disabled = true;\n              var original = btn.textContent;\n              btn.textContent = 'Adding...';\n              fetch('/cart/add.js', {\n                method: 'POST',\n                headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n                body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: variantId, quantity: 1 }] })\n              })\n                .then(function (res) { return res.ok ? res.json() : Promise.reject(res); })\n                .then(function () {\n                  btn.textContent = 'Added';\n                  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh'));\n                  setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = original; btn.disabled = false; }, 1800);\n                })\n                .catch(function () {\n                  btn.textContent = 'Try Again';\n                  btn.disabled = false;\n                });\n            });\n          });\n        })();\n      </script>\n    {% endif %}\n  </div>\n</details>"
          }
        },
