    "dynamic_faq_8AUh7M": {
      "type": "dynamic-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_nCTWbR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the Core work on its own, or do I need a module?",
            "answer": "<p>The Core is the foundation of your estate’s automation, quiet, capable, always ready. On its own it manages navigation, charging, and connectivity with total precision. To put that intelligence to work, mowing, clearing snow, or handling fall cleanup, you’ll pair it with a module. A bundle like the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> brings both together, so your estate is working from day one.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_69jhiF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the Core navigate without boundary wires?",
            "answer": "<p>No trenches. No wires. The Core reads your property through RTK GPS positioning, binocular vision, and multi sensor fusion, holding a line to within centimeters even beneath dense tree cover, where lesser systems lose their way. Your boundaries exist entirely in software, mapped once and respected forever.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_8KCdGW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of terrain can the Core handle?",
            "answer": "<p>Estates are rarely flat, and the Core was engineered accordingly. Its tracked, all-terrain chassis climbs grades up to 70% (35 degrees), ground that stops wheeled machines outright, and tows up to 3,500 lbs of rolling weight when the job calls for it. Slopes, transitions, difficult corners, all handled without hesitation.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_EcA6Mx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How many modules can I run on one Core?",
            "answer": "<p>One Core, every season. It supports the entire Yarbo lineup, Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, and Leaf Blower, so your estate transitions from spring to winter without ever needing a second machine. Swap modules in minutes and let the Core carry the intelligence forward.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_BQYmLz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if the Core encounters an obstacle?",
            "answer": "<p>Vision, RTK positioning, and real time obstacle detection work together continuously, identifying pets, toys, or furniture and routing around them before they’re ever a concern. Your property, and everyone on it, stays protected while the Core works.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_JjXiyk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the Core handle rain or bad weather?",
            "answer": "<p>Weather never interrupts the standard. Intelligent rain sensors and industrial grade IPX waterproofing let the Core sense a storm approaching, return to its dock, and wait it out in shelter, then resume exactly where it left off the moment conditions allow.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_JxkamV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of support do I get after purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>Ownership here means more than a warranty. Yard Automation Pros pairs Yarbo’s 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts with our own US based support team, on hand for mapping, setup, and the seasonal details that keep an estate running the way it should.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
